     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem action-applicability-behavior</b></p><a name=\"action-applicability-behavior\"> </a><a name=\"hcaction-applicability-behavior\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://hl7.org/fhir/action-applicability-behavior</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">all<a name=\"action-applicability-behavior-all\"> </a></td><td>All</td><td>The applicability of each action is evaluated independently; if the applicability criteria for an action evaluates to true, it is applied.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">any<a name=\"action-applicability-behavior-any\"> </a></td><td>Any</td><td>The applicability of each action is evaluated in order; the first action for which the applicability criteria evaluates to true is applied, and processing of the parent action stops.</td></tr></table></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
